tbots"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"display":"flex","alignItems":"center","gap":"16px","color":"#737373","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"June 14, 2026"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"AI in China"}]]}]]}],["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1200&q=80","alt":"China's 30,000 Smart Factories: Why the Real AI War Is Happening on the Factory Floor, Not in Chatbots","style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto","borderRadius":"12px","marginBottom":"48px"}}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","img","0",{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565043666747-69f6646db940?w=800&q=80","alt":"Industrial robot arm on semiconductor production line","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":"12px","margin":"24px 0"}}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*A robotic arm positions chip components on a semiconductor production line in Wuxi, Jiangsu Province. China's industrial AI deployment now spans 30,000 smart factories nationwide. (Photo: Unsplash)*"}]]}],["$","h2","3",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Conventional Wisdom: China's AI Edge Is Consumer Apps"}]]}],["$","p","5",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Walk into any tech conference in San Francisco or London in 2026, and you'll hear the same narrative. China's AI advantage, they say, lies in consumer-facing applications. DeepSeek's V4 model migrating from CUDA to domestic compute. Kimi's K2.6 with its 256K-token context window and 300-agent swarm. Doubao processing 120 trillion daily tokens. The \"AI Invisible Empire\" of consumer apps that has captured billions of users."}]]}],["$","p","7",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This narrative is not wrong. It is incomplete. Dangerously so."}]]}],["$","p","9",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The global discourse on China's AI revolution has been hijacked by the same metric that distorts Silicon Valley's self-image: model benchmarks, chatbot rankings, and consumer download numbers. Western analysts pore over SWE-Bench scores and MMLU leaderboards while missing the structural shift that may ultimately matter more for global economic power. China's industrial AI deployment—its integration of artificial intelligence into manufacturing, logistics, energy, and heavy industry—has accelerated so rapidly that it is now reshaping the global supply chain in ways that consumer AI cannot touch."}]]}],["$","p","11",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The numbers are staggering, and most of them never make it into the English-language tech press."}]]}],["$","h2","13",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Evidence: Numbers That Don't Fit the Chatbot Narrative"}]]}],["$","p","15",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The evidence is scattered across government statistics, corporate filings, and industry reports that rarely get translated into English. When assembled, it forms a picture that contradicts the dominant narrative about China's AI strategy."}]]}],["$","h3","17",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"China's Industrial AI Deployment Scale"}]]}],["$","div","33",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$